[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3803773589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3803773589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3803773589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iuPqV","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T08:19:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T08:19:41Z","body":"MRP is required","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3803773589/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804233017","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3804233017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3804233017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iv_05","user":{"login":"Ughuuu","id":2369380,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjkzODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2369380?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu","html_url":"https://github.com/Ughuuu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T09:59:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T10:00:54Z","body":"Managed to do a repro:\n\n[bone-repro 2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24879814/bone-repro.2.zip)\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47d34279-22fa-4bae-96ba-d0d5afb42da8\n\n## Notes:\n\t\nYou need to load the Animation in Animation Player from disk, as shown in the video. Otherwise in 4.5 it won't show. In 4.6 it will work (probably the formats are different)\n\nTry the animation `animation/move`. Some bones are animating wrong.\n\nAlso, notice how the root bone position is wrong.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804233017/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804553446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3804553446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3804553446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ixODm","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T11:10:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T11:10:09Z","body":"I've identified the cause, but we need to pinpoint why it's occurring. This issue seems to depend on the path name `Bone/Bone/Bone`, causing a mismatch between the track path and the actual scene tree path. The track for the 4th bone is being applied to the 1st bone instead.\n\nIt's unclear whether this is caused by track path binding occurring mid-object placement in the scene or a change in hash generation. It appears to be a regression introduced between dev4 and dev5.\n\nAs far as I recall, we changed the hash generation in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400 before dev4, but I don't remember making any other related fixes between dev4 and dev5. Therefore, it's possible that changes elsewhere, unrelated to animation, might be affecting this. It would be helpful if someone could assist with the bisect.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804553446/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804561854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3804561854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3804561854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ixQG-","user":{"login":"Ughuuu","id":2369380,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjkzODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2369380?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu","html_url":"https://github.com/Ughuuu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T11:12:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T11:12:11Z","body":"Interesting, so its a clash on path. I will check if changing the name of bones fixes it as a workaround to get me unblocked.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804561854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805189879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3805189879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3805189879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7izpb3","user":{"login":"Michael-Shevtsov","id":194423003,"node_id":"U_kgDOC5ao2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194423003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov","html_url":"https://github.com/Michael-Shevtsov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Michael-Shevtsov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T13:20:51Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T13:43:43Z","body":"I can add minimal repro and confirm that issue is related to the identical names of bones. Was going to create my own issue, but seems like it's already being tackled\n\n[bone-names.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24884390/bone-names.zip)\n\nThere are 2 scenes in the archive Works.tscn - works fine and Reproduces.tscn reproduces this bug, pretty self-explanatory.\n\nOn a side note, bug is more critical than it seems, because renaming of bones is quite inconvenient due to losing of polygon bindings on such renames. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805189879/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3806815250","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3806815250","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3806815250,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i52QS","user":{"login":"ugursoy","id":15056545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDU2NTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15056545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy","html_url":"https://github.com/ugursoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ugursoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T18:30:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T18:30:11Z","body":"I don't think issue is related to the nested/unique naming (or bones). But similar names creates an issue. Probably related to hashing as mentioned. I provided examples below.\n\nHere, I have a tool script that adds nested node2d>polygons or just polygons (with options to use unique names). I am dynamically creating animation tracks to modulate node2Ds' or polygons' (r,g,b,a) values. No bones or same names.\n\n**Tool Script:** [node_2d.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24892289/node_2d.zip)\n**Project:** [animation-track-bug-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24892285/animation-track-bug-test.zip)\n\nIn the project, I am adding nodes and name them alphabetically like [A_00, B_00 ... ]. When I add more than 28 nodes, animations start to break. That is the number of letters. So when names start with the same string like A_0# or B_0#, tracks mismatch somehow. Here is a demonstration:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad3c668d-36e4-47fc-ad6b-218e9ead3961\n\nSame thing happens with Godot's default naming as you can see in the video.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3806815250/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3806833764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3806833764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3806833764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i56xk","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T18:34:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T18:34:23Z","body":"Ah, I do recall seeing an issue related to string length before. I'll search it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3806833764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807070863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3807070863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3807070863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i60qP","user":{"login":"Ughuuu","id":2369380,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjkzODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2369380?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu","html_url":"https://github.com/Ughuuu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ughuuu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T19:21:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T19:21:24Z","body":"Bisected it down to this PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107264","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807070863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807088129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3807088129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3807088129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i644B","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T19:25:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T19:25:08Z","body":"> Bisected it down to this PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107264\n\nWhen hash randomness is problematic, note that the issue may occur randomly, potentially leading to incorrect good/bad determinations in the bisect process.\n\nSo, after reverting #110400, the issue was resolved, so I suspect #110400 was likely the cause. I thought it didn't reproduce on dev4, but upon checking again now, it did reproduce, so it might have been a misunderstanding or could occur randomly.\n\nLet's ask someone who worked on hashing @Ivorforce, @Nazarwadim, @beicause, @Ryan-000. We'll probably need countermeasures like salvaging https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110439.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807088129/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807122027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3807122027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3807122027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i7BJr","user":{"login":"Gabi-Bid","id":52347069,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzQ3MDY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52347069?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid","html_url":"https://github.com/Gabi-Bid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gabi-Bid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T19:32:58Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T19:32:58Z","body":"I have the same issue and I don't have similar names between assets and I don't even use bones\n\n<img width=\"674\" height=\"493\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a34ba141-14e1-4028-ae83-1e8c23250650\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807122027/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807152085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3807152085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3807152085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i7IfV","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T19:39:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T19:41:59Z","body":"Looking at the implementation of `NodePath::_update_hash_cache()`, that's the culprit. It appears to hash-combine the path parts merely by xor-ing them with the current hash, which result in the same hash for `A/B` as `B/A`. \n\nSo `NodePath` definitely needs a new hash function. It shouldn't be super high risk, although I'm not sure what the best approach is for combining consecutive hashes — i'm only passingly familiar, and we don't have a high level hashing API in core.\nIf we wanted to go safe for 4.6.1, we could also revert https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110400 for that branch.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807152085/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807167606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3807167606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3807167606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i7MR2","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T19:42:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T19:44:05Z","body":"> which result in the same hash for A/B as B/A.\n\nThen, I feel that the NodePath hash should be fixed because it currently serves no purpose as a hash.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807167606/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807241738","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3807241738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3807241738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i7eYK","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T19:57:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T19:57:24Z","body":"This should fix the issue, could someone test? https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115473\n\nrburing pointed out in chat that a bad hash shouldn't break behavior, and he's right. The bug indicates that the hash is used for equality checks, which should be fixed. However, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115473 should mitigate the issue from \"predictably often\" to \"very rare\".","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807241738/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894161340","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115407#issuecomment-3894161340","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115407","id":3894161340,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oHC-8","user":{"login":"mgiuca","id":228433,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODQzMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228433?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca","html_url":"https://github.com/mgiuca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgiuca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T00:35:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T00:35:45Z","body":"> However, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115473 should mitigate the issue from \"predictably often\" to \"very rare\".\n\nJust a note that I was able to reproduce the hash collision in 4.6.1-rc1: see #116231 for detailed notes and a script for generating hash collisions. I agree with the above statement (\"very rare\" turns out to be about one hash collision in ~100,000 nodes) but it is still plausible it could happen by accident.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894161340/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]